            "review_text": "Long N\n2 contributions\n0\nAn Open Cafe with Good Views\nApr 2017 • Friends\nThis is an open cafe on the 4th level. It has quite a good view over the atrium of Saigon Centre Mall. Quite comprehensive menu, I like their cafe and tea, good quality and good price compared to others in this Mall.There are some local dished as well. The place is comfortable, open but till privacy. Staff know what they are doing. Overall this is a good place to take a break or sit down for minutes,but I did dat down for nearly 2 hours :)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 24, 2017",
